{
  "schema": "BuildBattery@1",
  "about": "Varied build requests, each with checks written only from its own words and the answers supplied when the engine asks back. Never tuned against an engine run: the checks were written before any request in this file was built. `present` = the phrase appears in what the artifact shows (a page's visible text, a program's printed output); `distinct` = at least `min` of the listed phrases appear; `repeats` = at least `min` separate items (a page's innermost blocks, a program's lines) each contain one of the phrases; `absent` = none appears; `controls` = a page offers at least `min` inputs, buttons, text areas or selects. `marks` are matched as raw characters (a '$', a '?', a '37.7'); phrases are matched as whole words. `cafe` checks catch the fixed coffee-shop content leaking into a request that never asked for it.",
  "cafe": ["drinks", "opening hours", "espresso", "cappuccino", "smoothie", "latte"],
  "requests": [
    {
      "id": "dolphin-reddit",
      "prompt": "make a reddit but only for dolphin content",
      "kind": "page",
